  "releaseNotes": "LC045 now reports a navigation read on a loop variable inside an expression-level conditional (a ternary, a switch expression, ?. on the navigation, or ??), closing the gap 5.7.37 recorded. The loop variable's binding was attached to the block holding the body's earliest-starting operation, which for that shape is the merge block after the branches; it is now attached to the block the body is entered through.",
